{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And the messengers returned to Jacob, saying:</b> These emissaries fulfilled their mission, but Scripture did not relate this, for there is no need. And the sense of \"and he is also coming to meet you\" is to say: just as you are going to meet him, so too is he coming to meet you, and you will quickly encounter one another."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:21:49.857866791Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}